author=llloooggg
description=Tweaks for POCO F5 (marble) on Paranoid Android Vauxite: sensor-notifier with RawLightNotifier (under-display ALS compensation), HW rounded corners, V4L input scan off, earlier release of SF buffer slots, headset volume keys fix. Dolby stack is provided by a separate module.
